6. Microservice Boundaries
User Service
Owns: User entity. Handles sign up, login, and profile management.
Post Service
Owns: Post, Like, Comment entities. Handles image posts, likes, and comments together since they are tightly related and usually queried together.
Friendship / Connections Service
Owns: Follow entity. Handles follow/unfollow actions.
Messaging Service
Owns: Message entity. Handles one-to-one messaging.
Each service owns its own database, consistent with standard microservices practice.

